Subject: Reduce code duplication in HTTP header checks

(cherry picked from commit 3d9c02364db62a6d8e27947ffe47dbfaad644efe)
(cherry picked from commit 9642029fb3fd52711b236d5ae1dff3b00a9d80d1)
